    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast off by your lord, descend into the depths of the inferno to prove yourself and gain forgiveness! Traverse the 9 layers while dodging and weaving through the countless demons and sinners that seek to impede your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to brave the inferno? Will you prove to your lord that you're worth a second chance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD/Arrow Keys to Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC to pause/skip cutscene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to advance dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
